WEBVTT

00:01.391 --> 00:03.288
I don't regret being born in this life
to meet you guys!

00:04.867 --> 00:06.087
 Brothers for life!

00:06.112 --> 00:08.338
 - Cheers!
- Cheers!

00:08.394 --> 00:09.461
 Why did you come here?

00:09.486 --> 00:10.448
 To make money.

00:10.473 --> 00:11.408
 His father has kidney disease.

00:11.433 --> 00:13.716
 For me, I'm making money
to marry Ut Det.

00:13.725 --> 00:16.441
 His mom has a gambling addiction.

00:16.558 --> 00:17.889
 What are you going to do
when you come home?

00:17.913 --> 00:19.154
 But I can't leave my mom there!

00:19.631 --> 00:21.117
 We want to join the Chinatown gang.

00:22.016 --> 00:24.122
 All but two things can be traded here:

00:24.240 --> 00:26.199
 Except humans and drugs.

00:42.766 --> 00:44.791
Don't touch my bros.

00:48.193 --> 00:50.097
Why didn't you
let your juniors take them down?

00:50.122 --> 00:51.474
He's in the dark,

00:51.499 --> 00:52.725
and you're in the light now.

00:52.750 --> 00:53.772
Are you scared?

00:53.862 --> 00:55.739
If you're scared,
then I'm gonna finish them off myself!

00:55.763 --> 00:57.012
It's the Chinatown gang!

00:57.037 --> 00:58.612
The North Port gang can't wait any longer!

00:58.636 --> 01:01.221
How dare they touch Big Brother's area?

01:01.246 --> 01:02.325
As you know,

01:02.350 --> 01:04.864
they played dirty with
Big Brother over and over.

01:04.889 --> 01:07.606
We can't keep standing by to watch.

01:07.815 --> 01:10.248
We must show them who we are!

01:13.016 --> 01:14.517
Gangster is a one-way road.

01:15.331 --> 01:17.105
Once you've entered,

01:17.600 --> 01:18.920
you can only go straight forward.

01:18.975 --> 01:20.249
There's no turning back.

01:28.308 --> 01:30.168
Chan was used as bait.

01:30.715 --> 01:31.715
But...

01:31.740 --> 01:32.931
his death...

01:32.956 --> 01:34.283
was unexpected

01:34.308 --> 01:36.285
I want you
to travel to the North.

01:38.092 --> 01:39.228
This evening,

01:39.253 --> 01:40.573
let's break into Chinatown...

01:40.598 --> 01:42.450
and kill them all.

01:43.850 --> 01:44.674
Hanh!

01:44.699 --> 01:45.741
You messed with me,

01:45.766 --> 01:47.212
I'll mess with your bitch.

01:47.237 --> 01:50.410
Find me in The North Port
if you want your bitch back.

01:50.435 --> 01:51.435
Son of a bitch!

01:51.516 --> 01:52.516
We're...

01:52.558 --> 01:53.992
traveling there
to take revenge for Hanh.

01:54.016 --> 01:55.284
We don't even know
whether we would be able to survive.

01:55.308 --> 01:57.591
Who will take care of Ut Det
when you're gone?

01:57.725 --> 01:58.693
Her mom will.

01:58.718 --> 01:59.718
I'll follow you.

01:59.975 --> 02:00.709
For what?

02:00.808 --> 02:02.031
To take care of you.

02:03.295 --> 02:05.113
Have you heard anything about Hung?

02:05.862 --> 02:08.162
He is nothing more than
a rabid dog under Ky's command.

02:08.343 --> 02:10.746
He bites anyone
Ky commands him to.

02:10.771 --> 02:12.403
What if I want to meet Ky?

02:13.357 --> 02:15.489
Why didn't you
inform me that you came here?

02:15.514 --> 02:17.610
Bring Hac Hung to me,

02:17.635 --> 02:19.450
and I will let it slide.

02:25.641 --> 02:26.641
Nobody move!

02:27.891 --> 02:29.330
This place is not Chinatown.

02:29.396 --> 02:31.321
This fight is not yours to take.

02:43.766 --> 02:45.603
The blood debt
must be paid with blood.

02:46.310 --> 02:47.310
Phong!

02:53.719 --> 02:55.110
I must kill him...

02:55.135 --> 02:56.598
to take revenge for Ba!

03:13.046 --> 03:16.917
Roaming the street's end
and lane's edge, yet never yielding.

03:17.100 --> 03:20.667
Peddling dope and drugs,
yet always brotherhood shielding.

03:23.521 --> 03:25.177
After the turmoil

03:26.706 --> 03:27.791
of killings...

03:28.401 --> 03:29.401
bloodbaths...

03:30.214 --> 03:31.214
loss...

03:32.391 --> 03:33.703
and pain.

03:35.042 --> 03:35.642
Ba...

03:35.683 --> 03:36.733
In order to protect his friends,

03:36.758 --> 03:38.883
Ba gave his life in the battle
at The North Port.

03:39.148 --> 03:42.634
Hai Cuong ended up in jail,
facing the consequences of his actions.

03:42.763 --> 03:44.866
Using his abilities,

03:44.891 --> 03:47.674
Hao has led Chinatown
to function more expertly each day.

03:47.699 --> 03:50.241
He has created
multiple flourishing front businesses.

03:50.266 --> 03:53.354
Long and Phong
have become his powerful right-hand men.

03:53.597 --> 03:56.278
The security situation
is more unstable than ever.

03:56.393 --> 04:01.056
Hung's leadership in the battle against
crime has intensified at this phase.

04:02.725 --> 04:07.121
That action has had a direct impact
on the benefits of a covert group,

04:07.146 --> 04:09.371
forcing them to
free the tiger back into the woods.

04:09.530 --> 04:11.263
They are considered to be the Council,

04:11.288 --> 04:13.810
a group that
manipulates the underworld's hierarchy.

04:14.264 --> 04:15.074
Chinatown...

04:15.099 --> 04:16.912
is more unstable than ever.

04:41.391 --> 04:43.419
Hey...

04:43.475 --> 04:44.475
Thief!

04:58.400 --> 05:01.064
- Move away! Watch out!
- Where the hell are you going to?

05:02.589 --> 05:03.745
Drivng so fast, dude!

05:03.770 --> 05:06.052
Watch out!

05:29.859 --> 05:34.282
BROTHERS FOR LIFE 3

05:36.850 --> 05:39.641
[Episode 1: A maniac
dreams of becoming the king.]

05:47.794 --> 05:49.269
Should we call brother Long?

05:49.294 --> 05:51.824
I can handle those brats myself.

06:02.766 --> 06:03.700
Hey!

06:03.933 --> 06:04.933
Wake up.

06:05.141 --> 06:06.141
Hey!

06:06.808 --> 06:08.236
Doing drugs is prohibited here.

06:08.380 --> 06:09.380
Get out.

06:10.558 --> 06:11.558
What?

06:14.207 --> 06:16.164
Go find brother Long
and call an ambulance for me.

06:16.189 --> 06:17.465
Damn, it hurts!

06:42.036 --> 06:43.716
You couldn't even
manage such simple tasks.

06:43.741 --> 06:44.741
You've ruined it.

06:44.766 --> 06:46.284
How could we
ever complete the mission?

06:46.308 --> 06:47.409
I'm going to do it one last time.

06:47.433 --> 06:48.433
Are you clear?

07:02.882 --> 07:04.132
Long is back!
Long is back!

07:04.157 --> 07:05.164
Dismiss!

07:17.388 --> 07:18.465
Brother Long!

07:21.016 --> 07:22.016
I have a job for you.

07:23.475 --> 07:24.475
Go get prepared.

07:29.975 --> 07:31.616
Remember to clean up thoroughly.

07:31.641 --> 07:32.834
- Yes sir.
- Yes sir.

07:55.853 --> 07:56.853
Hello ma'am.

07:58.145 --> 07:58.995
Who are you guys?

07:59.020 --> 08:00.220
We're here for cleaning shits.

08:00.593 --> 08:01.346
Oh…

08:01.485 --> 08:02.723
Cleaning service.

08:03.395 --> 08:04.395
Ahhh...

08:05.087 --> 08:06.590
Come… Come in then.

08:07.046 --> 08:08.370
Hey, boss.

08:08.395 --> 08:09.584
The house owner looks hot.

08:09.609 --> 08:12.993
I wonder if
she divorced her husband yet.

08:19.946 --> 08:21.309
Mom, please come for lunch.

08:21.355 --> 08:22.091
Dung.

08:22.116 --> 08:23.370
Have a seat,

08:23.395 --> 08:24.910
I have something for you.

08:24.935 --> 08:25.935
What is it, mom?

08:26.595 --> 08:27.821
These are the heirloom earrings...

08:27.853 --> 08:29.120
my mother's grandmother...

08:29.145 --> 08:30.645
left me.

08:32.449 --> 08:35.324
I'd be happy if you take them.

08:38.207 --> 08:39.207
Oh, mom.

08:39.351 --> 08:41.804
If Long dares
to bully you in the future,

08:41.829 --> 08:44.454
just let me know.
I'll handle him for you.

08:44.479 --> 08:45.061
Thank you, mom.

08:45.061 --> 08:46.061
I'm home.

08:49.798 --> 08:51.274
What's the tension
I'm feeling right now?

08:51.299 --> 08:52.579
We've been speaking against you.

08:58.301 --> 08:59.704
Have a seat, mom.

09:03.979 --> 09:04.688
Mom.

09:04.816 --> 09:05.526
What?

09:05.638 --> 09:07.320
After the wedding,

09:10.785 --> 09:13.523
we will move back
to our hometown with you.

09:14.071 --> 09:14.770
What?

09:15.060 --> 09:16.060
Why so?

09:16.085 --> 09:18.601
Your company is doing well here.

09:18.676 --> 09:20.493
Why do you want to go back home?

09:20.518 --> 09:21.843
Well…

09:22.118 --> 09:24.828
We want to stay close
in order to take care of you.

09:25.886 --> 09:27.288
Really?

09:27.313 --> 09:31.446
I have a sense that you're going to
give me more problems instead.

09:31.471 --> 09:32.471
Mom.

09:32.660 --> 09:33.660
It could be.

09:34.243 --> 09:36.109
Oh, I have some mangoes here.

09:36.134 --> 09:38.745
Please give them to Mr. Hao later.

09:38.770 --> 09:39.245
Yes.

09:39.270 --> 09:41.352
I'll do it.
But could you leave me some?

09:41.790 --> 09:42.808
You brat.

09:42.833 --> 09:43.958
Let's start lunch.

09:54.148 --> 09:55.251
"Chow".

09:56.540 --> 09:57.510
Damn it!

09:57.535 --> 09:58.716
I quit!

09:59.235 --> 10:01.023
It's just a game,

10:01.048 --> 10:02.836
why so frustrating?

10:02.861 --> 10:04.045
How can I not be?

10:04.070 --> 10:06.449
I pay the fee every month,

10:06.474 --> 10:08.745
yet I've been unable
to make money out of my territory.

10:08.770 --> 10:10.498
How can I not be frustrated?
Tell me!

10:10.738 --> 10:13.642
Stay calm and let Hao handle it.

10:13.667 --> 10:15.059
Being hasty doesn't
help solving anything.

10:15.084 --> 10:16.684
So what now?
Are we still playing or not?

10:17.934 --> 10:19.598
So what now?
Are we still playing or not?

10:19.818 --> 10:21.452
If not, I'm leaving now.

10:38.162 --> 10:39.162
Brother Hao.

10:39.579 --> 10:41.168
Who is going to do it if you quit?

10:41.911 --> 10:43.111
Have you thought this through?

10:47.235 --> 10:48.235
Yes, I have.

10:52.395 --> 10:54.382
My mom is getting older.

10:54.407 --> 10:56.510
We want to be near
to take care of her

10:56.930 --> 10:58.242
after the wedding.

11:03.144 --> 11:04.144
Oh.

11:04.467 --> 11:06.411
My mom sent her regards...

11:06.436 --> 11:08.137
because you saved her life.

11:12.399 --> 11:14.016
You're like family to me.

11:14.345 --> 11:16.209
I consider your mom as my mom.

11:16.372 --> 11:17.757
It was what I must do.

11:18.027 --> 11:19.652
No need to be thankful.

11:20.160 --> 11:21.160
Yes, brother.

11:25.300 --> 11:27.362
I'm going to
hand over everything to Phong.

11:28.641 --> 11:29.641
Phong?

11:29.949 --> 11:30.949
Yes.

11:31.889 --> 11:32.889
Okay.

11:36.333 --> 11:38.165
But he needs more time.

11:39.599 --> 11:40.823
It's up to you, then.

11:46.586 --> 11:47.337
Take this.

11:47.362 --> 11:48.362
What is it?

11:48.586 --> 11:49.507
My wedding gift.

11:49.532 --> 11:50.726
Gosh, isn't it too much?

11:50.990 --> 11:53.230
Consider this your salary
for the time you worked for me.

11:54.000 --> 11:54.661
Oh.

11:54.686 --> 11:55.323
Hey,

11:55.348 --> 11:56.643
I haven't quit yet.

12:00.024 --> 12:02.854
About the remaining issues in Chinatown,
I can still help you out.

12:05.454 --> 12:06.454
Okay.

12:07.664 --> 12:09.861
Go get ready
for your wedding tomorrow.

12:12.426 --> 12:13.426
Yes, brother.

12:18.614 --> 12:19.614
Thank you, brother Hao.

12:20.181 --> 12:21.181
Go!

12:22.701 --> 12:23.701
I'm leaving now.

12:24.614 --> 12:25.614
See you tomorrow.

12:44.863 --> 12:46.009
[Bachelor Party]

12:48.985 --> 12:50.036
Is everything ready?

12:50.061 --> 12:52.040
I've prepared everything,
but it seems like they're not enjoying it.

12:52.065 --> 12:52.687
Why so?

12:52.712 --> 12:53.556
I have no idea.

12:53.715 --> 12:54.715
Tell everyone to come in.

12:54.740 --> 12:55.740
Yes, brother.

12:57.269 --> 12:58.207
Hey.

12:59.426 --> 13:00.739
Why haven't you picked one?

13:01.395 --> 13:01.978
Oh,

13:02.003 --> 13:03.003
you're waiting for me?

13:03.340 --> 13:03.953
Hey.

13:04.298 --> 13:05.298
You.

13:05.504 --> 13:06.161
Come here.

13:06.186 --> 13:06.603
Eh..

13:06.628 --> 13:07.426
Over here.

13:07.478 --> 13:08.478
You, over there.

13:10.032 --> 13:11.218
Don't embarrass me.

13:11.243 --> 13:12.485
Sit down.

13:12.510 --> 13:14.337
Just enjoy yourself.

13:14.938 --> 13:15.938
Don't you like it?

13:17.395 --> 13:18.219
Oh yeah.

13:19.206 --> 13:19.872
You!

13:19.897 --> 13:21.554
Bring all of them in for me.

13:21.579 --> 13:23.043
More chicks, more chicks please.

13:23.068 --> 13:23.651
Hey, stop it.

13:23.676 --> 13:24.968
Here, here.

13:25.360 --> 13:26.617
Come here.

13:29.501 --> 13:30.103
See?

13:30.104 --> 13:31.657
Long, Hung!
Pick one!

13:33.849 --> 13:34.849
What the hell is this?

13:35.035 --> 13:37.345
You told me
to bring all of them in.

13:37.370 --> 13:38.370
I did what you said.

13:38.630 --> 13:40.067
You idiot.

13:40.092 --> 13:41.361
Send her out.

13:41.386 --> 13:44.349
I'd like to return one of them, please.

13:44.590 --> 13:45.328
Phong, Phong.

13:45.353 --> 13:45.603
What?

13:45.628 --> 13:46.628
Stop this.

13:46.653 --> 13:48.571
What do you mean stop this?
It's not a meeting.

13:48.798 --> 13:51.884
This dude over here,
it's his wedding tomorrow.

13:51.909 --> 13:53.741
We must have a crazy party.

13:53.908 --> 13:54.620
Let's play!

13:54.645 --> 13:55.520
Phong, Phong, Phong.

13:55.520 --> 13:55.936
What?

13:55.961 --> 13:56.961
Listen.

13:57.336 --> 13:57.964
Thank you for doing this.

13:57.989 --> 13:58.488
Okay.

13:58.604 --> 13:59.604
You're welcome.

13:59.751 --> 14:00.497
Well...

14:00.522 --> 14:02.496
but I don't want
to do anything wrong to Dung.

14:02.735 --> 14:03.728
I'm leaving now.

14:19.207 --> 14:20.207
Damn you!

14:28.824 --> 14:30.904
Are you trying to
protect your images in front of me?

14:31.604 --> 14:32.629
Why?

14:34.337 --> 14:36.026
You call yourselves my brothers?

14:37.579 --> 14:38.715
I've planned everything.

14:41.004 --> 14:42.719
I've prepared every detail.

14:43.795 --> 14:46.096
It's all for your bachelor party.

14:54.712 --> 14:55.712
You assholes.

14:57.074 --> 14:58.994
How dare you tell me to stop?

15:00.442 --> 15:01.442
Party's over.

15:01.467 --> 15:03.020
Remember to be punctual tomorrow.

15:03.045 --> 15:04.045
Fuck no.

15:04.070 --> 15:05.070
Is he out of his mind?

15:06.256 --> 15:06.940
Hey...

15:06.965 --> 15:08.605
do they truly
have a tight brotherhood?

15:08.630 --> 15:09.630
I have no idea.

15:11.410 --> 15:12.902
Now would you excuse us?

15:12.927 --> 15:14.141
Please enjoy yourselves.

15:14.166 --> 15:15.427
Go, Go...

15:23.988 --> 15:24.988
What now?

15:25.863 --> 15:26.863
Let's go home.

15:31.027 --> 15:32.814
Okay, thanks everyone.

15:33.022 --> 15:34.587
Over here.

15:36.345 --> 15:37.932
Thanks for coming.
Thanks for coming.

15:38.254 --> 15:39.414
Have you seen Phong anywhere?

15:39.439 --> 15:41.482
Can I have a picture
with the bride, please?

15:42.056 --> 15:43.586
I haven't been
able to contact him all day.

15:43.587 --> 15:44.646
I suspect something happened.

15:44.670 --> 15:45.948
Gosh, what's the matter now?

15:45.962 --> 15:47.063
So he's making troubles again?

15:47.087 --> 15:48.664
Such an asshole.

15:50.189 --> 15:50.926
Long...

15:50.951 --> 15:52.090
Come here...

15:52.135 --> 15:53.369
Come on.

15:53.670 --> 15:55.159
Hey, congrats.

15:55.438 --> 15:55.854
Thanks, brother.

15:55.879 --> 15:56.837
Thank you.

15:56.862 --> 15:58.207
Say cheese!

16:01.330 --> 16:05.270
So, would you please
take your seats for the ceremony to begin?

16:05.295 --> 16:07.003
- Yes, sir!
- Yes, sir!

16:07.879 --> 16:08.879
Good.

16:09.103 --> 16:12.895
Before welcoming
the bride and the groom,

16:12.920 --> 16:14.408
I, Hao,

16:14.935 --> 16:17.312
have a few words
to share with the Chinatown brothers.

16:17.337 --> 16:18.142
What are you doing, boss?

16:18.167 --> 16:19.758
It's Long's wedding today.

16:20.100 --> 16:21.897
Okay, I'll keep it simple then.

16:22.181 --> 16:24.533
Ladies and gentlemen,

16:24.795 --> 16:27.562
please turn your attention to the aisle

16:27.587 --> 16:31.107
to welcome our bride and groom.

16:56.845 --> 16:59.515
I am honoured
to represent Chinatown…

17:00.420 --> 17:01.553
Oops, my mistake.

17:03.621 --> 17:05.210
On behalf of the bride's family,

17:05.490 --> 17:08.194
I have a few words for the groom.

17:11.420 --> 17:12.420
Long.

17:13.170 --> 17:14.577
You know...

17:14.658 --> 17:16.530
I consider Dung as...

17:16.555 --> 17:18.165
my own little sister.

17:18.629 --> 17:20.010
I hope...

17:20.035 --> 17:22.655
you shall give her all the love

17:22.923 --> 17:23.923
and take good care...

17:24.212 --> 17:25.624
of her

17:26.329 --> 17:27.929
for the rest of your life.

17:28.462 --> 17:29.629
Today,

17:30.629 --> 17:31.809
I officially...

17:32.439 --> 17:34.036
hand her over to you.

17:34.467 --> 17:35.854
I wish for both of you to...

17:35.879 --> 17:37.358
live happily ever after.

17:40.205 --> 17:41.716
Applause, please!

17:52.290 --> 17:53.332
Thank you so much.

17:54.436 --> 17:55.720
Exchange the rings.

17:56.222 --> 17:57.263
Exchange the rings.

17:57.483 --> 17:58.624
Yes. Yes.

18:01.412 --> 18:02.787
Applause, please!

18:09.114 --> 18:10.590
Applause!

18:13.462 --> 18:19.118
Kiss! Kiss!

18:19.143 --> 18:19.926
No!

18:30.874 --> 18:32.332
What are you doing?
Phong.

18:32.629 --> 18:33.562
Phong.

18:34.192 --> 18:35.312
Don't you dare make a scene.

18:35.754 --> 18:36.645
Go!

18:36.670 --> 18:38.145
Let's start!

18:38.170 --> 18:38.604
One,

18:38.629 --> 18:39.104
two,

18:39.129 --> 18:39.648
three,

18:39.673 --> 18:40.006
four,

18:40.045 --> 18:40.588
five,

18:40.613 --> 18:40.946
six,

18:41.004 --> 18:41.395
seven,

18:41.420 --> 18:42.078
eight.

18:42.103 --> 18:43.020
Two, two,

18:43.020 --> 18:43.478
three,

18:43.478 --> 18:43.936
four,

18:43.936 --> 18:44.353
five,

18:44.353 --> 18:44.728
six,

18:44.728 --> 18:45.270
seven,

18:45.270 --> 18:45.645
eight.

18:45.670 --> 18:46.145
One,

18:46.145 --> 18:46.561
two,

18:46.561 --> 18:46.978
three,

18:46.978 --> 18:47.395
four,

18:47.395 --> 18:48.020
five,

18:48.020 --> 18:48.489
six,

18:48.514 --> 18:48.880
seven,

18:48.905 --> 18:49.280
eight.

18:49.305 --> 18:49.846
One,

18:49.871 --> 18:50.383
two,

18:50.408 --> 18:50.844
three,

18:50.869 --> 18:51.869
four...

19:07.966 --> 19:09.323
One, two, three, cheers!

19:09.348 --> 19:13.015
Two, three, cheers!

19:13.303 --> 19:14.695
Thank you everyone.

19:14.720 --> 19:16.673
Hey, don't drink too much.
You'll be hungover.

19:16.698 --> 19:17.864
I can handle my booze.

19:18.075 --> 19:19.782
Hey, you rock today.

19:19.807 --> 19:20.724
I thought you
only came here to drink...

19:20.749 --> 19:22.192
Hey, watch out.

19:41.022 --> 19:42.652
We're closed.
Everybody go home.

19:42.677 --> 19:44.622
Who the fuck are you?

19:59.079 --> 20:00.661
Help me keep everybody company.

20:00.686 --> 20:01.695
Okay.

20:01.720 --> 20:02.762
Okay, bye guys.

20:02.787 --> 20:03.542
Alright, leave it to me.

20:03.567 --> 20:05.118
Thanks everyone.
Thanks for coming.

20:05.585 --> 20:07.222
- Cheers!
- Cheers!

20:07.516 --> 20:10.554
Hey! Hey!
Hey! Hey!

20:10.579 --> 20:12.024
Brothers for life!

20:12.049 --> 20:14.443
Cheers!

20:20.365 --> 20:21.591
Stay outside.

20:46.090 --> 20:47.506
What do you want?

20:50.228 --> 20:51.228
I want Chinatown

20:52.321 --> 20:53.321
under my control.

21:01.460 --> 21:02.646
Fuck!

22:29.996 --> 22:30.996
Boss!

22:35.712 --> 22:36.712
Hurry up!

23:41.888 --> 23:46.752
 BROTHERS FOR LIFE 3
